			"iconCode": "fa-droplet",
			"disabled": false,
			"description": "The fire register. Street counterpart: <em>the scorch</em> / <em>burnt batch</em>. From <em>empyreuma</em>, the burnt smell of organic matter spoiled by heat in a retort.",
